{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04485","headline":"江上暂别萧四刘三旋欣接遇 · 陈子昂","name":"江上暂别萧四刘三旋欣接遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨夜沧江别，言乖天汉游。\n宁期此相遇，尚接武陵洲。\n结绶还逢育，衔杯且对刘。\n波潭一弥弥，临望几悠悠。\n山水丹青杂，烟云紫翠浮。\n终愧神仙友，来接野人舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04485.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04485","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}